    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a math addition and subtraction puzzle game. The interface displays addition/subtraction equations with question marks, and number options lie at the bottom. Players mentally calculate the unknowns (sum, addend, minuend, etc.) and tap the correct answer \u2014 right choices earn points and advance progress, training basic arithmetic skills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core experience: By randomly placing the question mark (as addend, minuend, subtrahend, or sum), the game forces flexible use of addition/subtraction formulas, avoiding rote memorization. Cartoon - styled geometry and bright colors reduce learning stress, suiting young players or basic arithmetic practice.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a math enlightenment game blending fun and educational value.</p>",
